      "text": "Day 2 · After breakfast, discover two of Rio’s most iconic landmarks. First, Christ the Redeemer, perched atop Corcovado: ascend through the lush tropical rainforest to the summit, where the outstretched arms of the statue welcome you, with panoramic views of the beaches and the bay.\nThe journey continues to Sugar Loaf Mountain (Pão de Açúcar), where the cable car reveals a 360-degree view of Rio: the green Tijuca Forest, the deep blue of Guanabara Bay and the city’s neighbourhoods spread out below.",
